abstract: >-
  A UHP-compatible Hive engine in Rust and an AlphaZero-style self-play
  pipeline, used for two pre-registered comparisons of a grid convolutional
  network and a capacity-matched graph message-passing network in base-game
  Hive, with five independent seeds per arm, frozen opponents and openings,
  and two budget readings. Release v2.1-report contains both studies, the
  code, the frozen protocols and the per-game records.
keywords:
  - Hive
  - AlphaZero
